  "body_html": "<p>Embrace the symbolic beauty of the sacred Tree of Life with this custom quilt set by Jeminise. Perfect for nature lovers, this bedding set offers a lightweight feel that provides breathable warmth in the summer and cozy comfort during the winter. Designed for versatile indoor and outdoor use, it serves beautifully as a bed quilt, cozy throw blanket, or even a picnic mat for camping adventures. With customizable options, you can personalize this unique piece with your own chosen text, background settings, or sentimental names to create a deeply meaningful home decor piece or a thoughtful gift for birthdays, holidays, and special family milestones.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Fully customizable aspects allow you to adjust the background, framing colors, or add custom text saying squares with names of loved ones or pets.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Made with a 100% soft polyester outer layer and filled with high-quality silk floss for long-lasting breathable comfort and warmth.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Multi-functional design is perfect as a bed quilt, living room throw blanket, picnic mat, or a cozy companion for backyard lounging and camping.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in a range of sizes to suit your space, including Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), and King (91x102 inches).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable fabric designed to quickly dry while resisting pilling, fading, and wrinkling for low-maintenance daily care.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Optional Components:</strong> Bedding set includes 1 quilt with the optional addition of matching pillowcases in quantities of 2 or 4 to complete your look.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Silk Floss</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Tree of Life-ds13</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Farmhouse</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Tree of Life, Flowers, Fantasy Nature</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Tree of Life, Yggdrasil</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + Optional Pillowcases</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>Text Input Enabled</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
